<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB bills gross 12.4 pct, undersubscribed.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB bills gross 12.4 pct, undersubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Czech National Bank (CNB) Dutch-style auction offering five billion crowns of 13 week central bank bills was undersubscribed by 106 million crowns on a gross yield of 12.4 percent, the CNB said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The gross yield was unchanged from a similar auction last week. -- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
